	"findings": [
		"Jazz already shares identical QuerySubscription/One cache keys within one client. All sampled exact native signatures are unique.",
		"AccountCreation active-account query lacks orderBy(name); WorkspaceBootstrap/accounts route/transaction entry use the same active-account predicate with orderBy(name). This produces an extra SDK subscription while the dialog is closed.",
		"Opening/closing Add Account changes neither active native count nor cumulative acquisition count (11 throughout). Dialog-only wrappers are eager, not independently leaked.",
		"Unsubmitted description typing produces no new native query acquisition in the saved-detail sample.",
		"A remote memo change produces three observed SDK deltas; an additional editor-profile query is legitimate after a different author edits the row.",
		"Workspace replacement releases old consumer bindings; SDK retains unused entries about 30 seconds. After observed cleanup, active entries return to 11 and no old-workspace-scoped query remains.",
		"Historical list and edit-option queries differ in archive predicates, includes, ordering, or projection; their result requirements cannot be merged solely because the fixture is small."
	],
